sequenceDiagram
  participant I as Native iPhone
  participant M as Native Mac
  participant A as Authenticated Fort API
  participant L as Transactional ledger
  participant R as Isolated runner
  participant P as Official provider runtime
  I->>I: Persist request ID, input and intended binding
  I->>A: Submit exact command with request ID
  A->>L: Commit message, run, snapshot, outbox and event together
  L-->>A: Durable receipt and cursor
  A-->>I: Accepted, not yet confirmed running
  A-->>M: Replay accepted event for same Home
  Note over I,L: Lost response: resend/query same ID; changed payload conflicts
  L->>R: Claimed exact dispatch with attempt and fencing generation
  R->>P: Bounded task with pinned model, skills and authority
  P-->>R: Correlated start, approval request, output or terminal evidence
  R->>A: Scoped evidence; cannot approve its own action
  A->>L: Commit approval request or normalized run state
  A-->>I: Pending action or persisted progress
  I->>A: Owner decision bound to action digest and attempt
  A->>L: Atomically record first valid decision
  L->>R: Bounded approved continuation
  R->>P: Continue only matching action
  P-->>R: Terminal evidence
  R->>A: Correlated result
  A->>L: Commit result and terminal event
  Note over A,P: Crash after possible effect: record uncertainty; never blind resend
  Note over I,M: Apps may close or lose connectivity; iPhone does not execute the task
  I->>A: Reconnect with cursor and pending request IDs
  A->>L: Read canonical snapshot and replay boundary
  A-->>I: Ordered durable history and recovery state
  M->>A: Reconnect after service restart
  A-->>M: Same Home, identity, history and truthful state
